    <string name="about_source">Source code</string>
    <string name="about_text">Sofabird — a remote for VLC 3.0.x on Windows. The VLC password and companion token are kept in the phone\'s encrypted storage. Levels: VLC over HTTP → VLC + Lua pages (current track, chapters) → companion (discovery, VLC launch, system functions).</string>

